{"id":"immerzu","lemma":"immerzu","pos":"adv","rank":4639,"glosses":["incessantly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ce/De-immerzu.ogg/De-immerzu.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er will uns immerzu irgendwas sagen.","en":"He's always trying to say something to us.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null,null,{"g":"to say (to pronounce"}]},{"text":"Immerzu versucht sie, anderen zu helfen.","en":"She always tries to help others.","words":[null,{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"versuchen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"another , others","l":"anderer"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Du siehst immerzu fern.","en":"You're watching TV all the time.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},null,{"g":"remote"}]},{"text":"Ihr seht immerzu fern.","en":"You're watching TV all the time.","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},null,{"g":"remote"}]},{"text":"Sie sehen immerzu fern.","en":"You're watching TV all the time.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to see"},null,{"g":"remote"}]}]}